    "text_full": "?\nenclose.horse\n--\n--\n--\nHome Create Level Browse Levels About Updates Strategy Guide Contact Privacy Policy Terms of Service Tutorial Support\nContact Us\n\nWe love hearing from players! Whether it's a bug report, a feature request, a puzzle idea, or just a quick hello — we want to know about it.\n\nThe best way to reach us is through our feedback form:\n\nSend Feedback →\n\nYou can also follow along or join the conversation:\n\n@enclose_horse\n@enclose.horse\n\nYou can also email us at hello@enclose.horse. Due to volume, we may not be able to reply to every email — for the fastest response, use the feedback form above.\n\nWe read every piece of feedback that comes in. Your input is valued and helps shape the game!\nAbout · Updates · Privacy · Terms · Contact\n© 2025–2026 enclose.horse"
